{
  "sourceLanguage": "ja",
  "strings": {
    "Cull はライブラリの写真とビデオを1枚ずつ表示して整理します。削除は確認のうえ「最近削除した項目」に移動されます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cull shows your photos and videos one at a time so you can sort them. Deletions are confirmed first and go to Recently Deleted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@（%lld）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ (%2$lld)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 件を選択": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld Selected"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 件を整理しました。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sorted %lld items."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「保持」にした %lld 件が再び整理対象になります。ゴミ箱の内容は変わりません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld kept items will be shown again. Cull's trash is not affected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "お気に入り": {
      "localizations": {
