    "選択": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Select"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "選択しない場合は写真・ビデオ・Live Photos すべてが対象です。複数選択するといずれかに当てはまるものが対象になります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With nothing selected, all photos, videos and Live Photos are included. Selecting several includes items matching any of them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
